## GitHub Actions

Both repos have `workflow_dispatch` (manual trigger only — saves GitHub Actions minutes):

- `convision-api-golang/.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — builds and deploys backend
- `convision-front/.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — builds and deploys frontend

Required GitHub secrets: `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`, `EC2_SSH_KEY`, `DB_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`.

**Preferred deployment method: `bash deploy.sh dev` locally** — faster and more transparent than GHA.

