## Quick Checklist — When User Asks About AWS

1. **Is the SSO session active?** → `aws sts get-caller-identity --profile convision-admin`
2. **Is the EC2 running?** → `bash infra.sh dev status` or check AWS console
3. **Is the API healthy?** → `curl https://api.opticaconvision.com/health`
4. **Need to deploy?** → `bash deploy.sh dev` (from monorepo root)
5. **Need to start infra?** → `bash infra.sh dev start`
6. **Need to run migrations?** → Copy to EC2, run `migrate ... up`
7. **DNS issues?** → Check `dig A api.opticaconvision.com @ns57.domaincontrol.com` (GoDaddy NS)
